# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# No pattern at all: classic C9 bulbs. `bulb-string` is a 32x12 tile of two
# sagging strings whose two frames trade which half of the bulbs glows; tiled
# over the whole panel it is a curtain of lights. The box is an EXPLICIT 64x64
# (a zero box would draw one tile at natural size), so on a 32x32 it simply
# clips to the panel. On a strip this needs scenes-on-strips (the planned
# strip-bulbs scene); on any matrix it works today.
S - Bulb String
L color 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Night
K 06040a
L sprite 0 1 64 63 normal 100 none tile 1
N Bulbs
I @spr/bulb-string
